   "id": 505171,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Correctly apply the order of operations to compute the following:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"13+{3^4}\\times8/6\\times{5^2}-3\\times4\">13+{3^4}\\times8/6\\times{5^2}-3\\times4</span>.</p>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"13 + {3^4} + 8/6 + {5^2}-3 \\times 4\"></span></p>\n<p>Use PEMDAS.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Calculate the exponents.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"13 + 81 \\times 8/6 \\times 25-3 \\times 4\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply times 8.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"13 + 648/6 \\times 25-3 \\times 4\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divide by 6.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"13 + 108 \\times 25-3 \\times 4\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply by 25.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"13 + 2,700-3 \\times 4\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply by 4.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"13 + 2,700-12\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"2,713-12\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtract.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"2,701\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2,701"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
